":"Rowdy Toys (9)","lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2020-02-20T22:29:24+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c4d42a2a-57bc-40b9-a6fb-23c59ef92644","number":"501","volume":"52","title":"Rowdy Toys (8)","lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2019-12-09T21:29:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":500,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:21.147Z"},"c1123e0a-647b-4e27-9558-0e156921616b":{"id":"c1123e0a-647b-4e27-9558-0e156921616b","title":"Nerd Nam ui Heukhwa reul Maga Bogetseumnida","altTitle":"Let’s Try to Prevent the Darkening of the Nerd Lead","description":"<What happened in St. John’s College>\n\nShe transmigrated into a novel that is only 1% romance. It was a 19+, mature, smut novel. However, she never cared that the novel she transmigrated into was considered trash by everyone else.\n\n\"Thank you very much for reincarnating me as an extra who doesn't even appear in the original story!'\n\nThough, she had no plans of interacting with any of the main characters! After graduating, she plans to become a daring author and live a carefree life, free of stress!\n\nFate, on the other hand, seems to have an entirely different plan...\n\n\"It's here, the place where tragedy will befall in the near future...\"\n\nDue to some mix up, Genevieve, who planned to enrol in Four Gates Academy, ended up enrolling in Saint John's College.\n\nWhether this is fortunate or not, it was only after she entered Saint John's College did she realise that she had transmigrated before the main characters even appeared!\n\nUnfortunately,  just as she peacefully started her third year, fate just had to continue twisting things out of her favour.\n\n\"You're the senior Genevieve Darling, right?\"\n\nThe novel's second male lead, who mind you, will commit a great massacre in the future, is actively seeking her out?!!!\n\nBut...\n\n\"...I apologise for bothering you. I'll be quiet so I do not disturb you while you do your assignments.\"\n\n\"You're the one who was being harassed, so why are you apologising?!\"\n\nThe corrupted second male lead is too gentle right now, even if he had a dark past, this is...\n\nFrom that moment on, Genevieve had made up her mind. Even if she does not change what happens in the original novel, she believes that when Edward remembers this period of his life later on, she will be able to give him at least one good memory!\n\n\"It's okay, Edward. You can stay right here.\"\n\nWill Genevieve fulfil her goal of giving the second male lead pleasant memories?","year":2023,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Comedy","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/c1123e0a-647b-4e27-9558-0e156921616b/e7037a02-72b6-48e0-b78d-766422af298a.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en","id"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.14,"follows":666,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:58:11.468Z","chapters":[{"id":"3ddb066f-7564-46e0-9f5c-d2b26d224de7","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-01-31T13:10:41+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2c3d2f53-b1f7-4d98-9020-f222dfc4cdfa","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2024-02-05T20:26:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:31:31.240Z"},"f2ca43d0-7184-4f42-ad42-9ceeaf47a5b8":{"id":"f2ca43d0-7184-4f42-ad42-9ceeaf47a5b8","title":"Born to Bleed","altTitle":"The Villain of the Octagon","description":"Shin Chi-beom is a talentless amateur mixed martial artist.\n\nAfter disappearing for a week, he suddenly shows up for his next fight, suffering from extreme anxiety, and steps into the cage and kills his opponent, leaving everyone wondering why he's changed.\n\nA week ago, he fell asleep and woke up in ancient Greece, where he was a combat slave in the Pankration, a murderous martial arts competition. Five years of life-and-death duels, dozens of times a day, in countless battles, have passed...\nAfter the final battle, he is returned to his original body.\n\nShin Chi Bum is left with severe trauma and a mental illness. The only place he can find peace of mind is in an octagonal iron cage. The only place he can find peace of mind is in a cold, octagonal iron cage. He continues to search for the strongest... \n\nWill he ever find rest at the end of the fight?","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Sports","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f2ca43d0-7184-4f42-ad42-9ceeaf47a5b8/a8b2726b-ebcb-49d9-a7f2-c4096213bfbc.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["id"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.64,"follows":742,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:58:17.623Z","chapters":[{"id":"79354692-640d-4d75-9614-64e914acefac","number":"20","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-24T08:11:27+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b16d1ba1-0280-4932-b919-131c1b36bd09","number":"19","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-24T08:10:28+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a562a487-dbec-44db-8eb2-5a1a7836f619","number":"18","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-24T08:08:57+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c1b6451f-34e0-404d-ad87-3bae65566eee","number":"17","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":13,"createdAt":"2025-11-21T21:20:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c5be25d2-12fe-4390-8225-e229356d2420","number":"16","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-21T21:20:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0912dd76-ddd3-4c3a-b50f-865ad6232b27","number":"15","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-21T21:19:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ae471641-00e2-4038-bccf-ffa5676287f5","number":"14","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11-21T21:19:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6b486ef8-393c-4e75-885b-91f8e94a890d","number":"13","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2025-11